o core)  | Multi-agent pipeline turns ideas into shippable web products (landing or full stack), runs storefront + admin, owns keys and gates  | magic-ai-factory.com · `:9080` self-host\nAIMarket (same monorepo)  | Federation hub indexes capabilities, routes invoke, runs plugins (safety, escrow, reputation), settles on-chain  | modelmarket.dev · Hub `:9083`\nHEPHAESTUS  | `hephaestus/` → alexar76/hephaestus  | The forge — price capability chains before you spend · modelmarket.dev/studio\nTreasury  | `treasury/` → alexar76/treasury  | Separate bounty payer (finder/fixer/conductor split)\nSignal Hunt  | `signal-hunt/` → alexar76/signal-hunt  | Investigation game + educational lab over real Hub telemetry · Signal-Hunt\nDIOSCURI  | `dioscuri/` → alexar76/dioscuri  | Twin community agents (Telegram CASTOR · Discord POLLUX)\nTHEOROS  | `theoros/` → alexar76/theoros  | Agent Sovereignty Canon · Discord `#the-canon`\nHELIOS  | `helios/` → alexar76/helios  | Broadcast pipeline (template → voiced video → YouTube queue)\nMCP oracle gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-oracle-gateway  | stdio MCP — 35 pay-per-call oracle tools\nMCP ecosystem gateway  | alexar76/aimarket-mcp  | `web_fetch` · `web_search` · `metis_verify`\nSchool / Courses  | `school/` · `courses/`  | edu.modelmarket.dev · aimarket-courses\nMCP packager  | alexar76/aimarket-plugins  | Package hub capabilities as Docker + MCP manifest\nalien-monitor  | 3D ecosystem visualizer\nargus  | ARGUS-3 · wiki\nattested-memory  | Attested Memory — verifiable memory for AI agents · attestedmemory.net\nlottery  | On-chain oracle lottery dApp\naimarket-school  | Clip on-ramp · edu.modelmarket.dev\naimarket-courses  | 13 academies · portal\naicom.wiki  | This wiki (mirrored from `scripts/wiki-gitea/`)\n\nPublish all mirrors: `./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh` (monorepo maintainers).\n\n## Typical production split\n\nHost  | Service  | Port\n--- | --- | ---\nFactory VPS  | AI-Factory Compose  | 9080 (UI) · 9081 (API direct)\nSame or peer VPS  | AIMarket Hub  | 9083 → internal 9080\n\nGuide: `docs/production-modelmarket-dev.md`\n\n* * *\n\n## Personas\n\nPersona  | Primary surface  | Goal\n--- | --- | ---\nFactory operator  | Admin `/admin`, CLI, wiki Owner-Guide  | Run pipeline, curate storefront, wire LLMs\nCapability builder  | Admin + hub listing  | Price and attest tools for agents\nEnd user  | Storefront, desktop app, widget  | Buy or invoke capabilities\nAutonomous agent  | `cli/ai_market_agent.py`, MCP  | Discover → pay → invoke without UI--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\naimarket · GitHub Topics · GitHub (https://github.com/topics/aimarket)\nciteturn75search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 months ago; Live portal: edu.modelmarket.dev\n### alexar76 / aimarket-school\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nAIMarket School — 10 free clip lessons (Try-it + Colab) that on-ramp into the academies. Live portal: edu.modelmarket.dev\n\neducation tutorials colab ai-agents oracles agent-economy aimarket\n\n  * Updated Aug 7, 2026\n  * Python\n\n### alexar76 / theoros\n\nStar\n\n  * Code\n  * Issues\n  * Pull requests\n  * Discussions\n\nTHEOROS — Agent Sovereignty Canon. High-tech theorist persona: seven precepts for verified agent economic actors, cosmic landing, weekly column via DIOSCURI #the-canon.\n\ncommunity constitution philosophy metis devrel dioscuri ai-agent agent-economy aimarket aicom agent-sovereignty\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nGitHub - alexar76/aicom: AI-Factory — autonomous pipeline that designs, builds, tests, and publishes products. · GitHub (https://github.com/alexar76/aicom)\nciteturn75search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 weeks ago; AIMarket School  | `aimarket-school`  | 13 free clip lessons (EN/RU/ES/FR/ZH) · edu.modelmarket.dev ↗\nThe verdict comes from an LLM jury (Metis) judging the delivery against the intent the buyer wrote — evidence, not proof. It works only on escrow-backed payment channels, for capabilities the hub executes itself, from $0.05. → What it does not promise · How to enable it · A run on real money\n\nDiscussions: Roadmap · Q&A · Show & Tell · Announcements: Roadmap updates\n\n> ### 🟢 Try the live agent economy in 30 seconds — no wallet, no Docker, no clone\n> \n> Paste this one URL into any MCP client (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, …):\n> \n> ##    `https://modelmarket.dev/mcp`\n> \n> You get two tools against the live hub: `market_search` finds a capability in the published catalogue, `market_invoke` runs one and hands back the hub's signed receipt. A few trial invokes per caller are free — no key, no account, no wallet, nothing to install. When the allowance runs out the hub answers 402 and the on-chain escrow path begins, which is where the wallet finally matters.\n## Positioning\n\nAI-Factory is a different shape from hosted builders like Bolt.new, Lovable, v0, or Devin: it’s a self-hosted MIT pipeline you run on your own box with your own LLM keys, and it persists artifacts, state, and gates on disk you control. Those products are polished hosted experiences and ship features we don’t have (cloud editor, team accounts, prebuilt integrations); we trade that for transparency, no per-seat pricing, and the option to fork. If you want zero-ops and a managed UI, use them. If you want the agents, gates, and storefront under your control, keep reading.\n\n### Part of the AIMarket ecosystem\n\nShipped products can sync to the AIMarket Hub (protocol v2, SDKs, desktop apps). Sibling projects — ARGUS, lottery, oracles, Monitor, Metis, MCP gateway — live in their own repos; see Ecosystem map. Map: ecosystem.modelmarket.dev.\n\n## The pipeline\n    \n    flowchart LR\n      A[💡 Idea] --> B[🔍 Discovery]\n      B --> C[📋 Analyst]\n## Monorepo & AIMarket ecosystem\n\nThis repository is the AICOM monorepo: a self-hosted AI-Factory pipeline plus the AIMarket federated commerce layer (hub, protocol, 